# Catalog audio is served from the public Blob CDN (migrated out of the build
# 2026-06-15, see lib/audioCdn.ts). Kept out of git so server-side Vercel
# builds stay under the lambda/bundle limit and git CI/CD can run.
# Exception: transition beds + DJ narration (~5MB) are needed at build time for
# manifest generation, so keep them tracked for CI parity with local builds.
!frontend/public/audio/beds/**
!frontend/public/audio/narration/**
